---
component: chase
effects: true
params:
  tactic: { type: { enum: [hide, run, freeze, lantern] } }
  flavor: { type: string, default: "You do the only thing left." }
---

## Chase
/* The chase minigame. The engine plays it out; this says what the outcome
means. A beat that needs more (Tobias) reads scene.evade.chase.outcome
after the ::use. */
@narrator{code="0010"}: {{@flavor}}
::evade{tactic=@tactic resultKey="chase"}
<match subject="scene.evade.chase.outcome">
  <when is="lost">
    @narrator{code="0020"}: The wheels squeal past. They slow. They go on down the corridor.
    ::set{run.chases += 1}
  </when>
  <when is="hurt">
    @narrator{code="0030"}: A hand like a cold towel closes on your ankle. Then it lets go, as if it had only been counting you.
    ::fright{amount=2}
    ::fright
    ::set{run.chases += 1}
  </when>
  <when is="taken">
    @orderly{code="0010"}: Lights out, love. Back to bed.
    @narrator{code="0040"}: The gurney is warm. Someone was on it a moment ago.
    ::set{run.fate = "taken"}
    ::set{user.deaths += 1}
  </when>
</match>
